name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q12_2026'

question 'A shopping app gives free shipping when a user''s order is over $50 AND the user is a member. A non-member spending $300 does not get free shipping. A teacher asks: "Who does this rule keep out?" What is the most useful student response?'

wrong 'The rule keeps out people whose internet is too slow to load the checkout page.'
wrong 'The rule keeps out everyone — free shipping is never offered.'
wrong 'No one is kept out because the rule is fair.'
right 'The rule keeps out non-members who spend a lot, and it''s worth asking whether the rule should be changed to include them.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

